le":"Were Hiring Graphic Designer","company":"Kyrascope","location":"Noida","date_posted":"2026-09-05","url":"https://www.shine.com/jobs/were-hiring-graphic-designer/kyrascope/19536568","experience":"0 to 4 Yrs","skills":[115,117],"is_walkin":false},{"title":"Junior Visual Designer","company":"DigitalXNode","location":"Noida","date_posted":"2026-09-05","url":"https://www.shine.com/jobs/junior-visual-designer/digitalxnode/19535162","experience":"1 to 5 Yrs","skills":[103,107,115,117],"is_walkin":false},{"title":"User Experience Designer  12 + Years of Experience IRC300811","company":"GlobalLogic","location":"Noida","date_posted":"2026-09-05","url":"https://www.shine.com/jobs/user-experience-designer-years-of-experience-irc/globallogic/19534471","experience":"12 to 16 Yrs","skills":[103,116],"is_walkin":false,"description":"**Description**\n Hybrid Model\n   \n\n  \n\n Exp\\-12\\+ Years of experience\n   \n\n  \n\n Location:\\- Noida\n   \n\n  \n\n**Requirements**\n**Role: User Experience Designer**\n**Experience: 12 Years to 18 Years**\n**Location: Noida**\n**Key Responsibilities:**\n Gather insights for business visions, goals and end users through discovery workshops with stakeholders\n   \n\n  \n\n Conduct user research to identify the pain points, aspirations and challenges of end users\n   \n\n  \n\n Define persona, journey maps and storyboards to identify, communicate and priorities the opportunity areas which leads to creation of MVP (minimum viable product)\n   \n\n  \n\n Engages team and cross\\-functional stakeholders to make them understand user\u2019s needs and guide the team in the creation of thoughtful interactive solutions\n   \n\n  \n\n Ideate about product\u2019s main characteristics, functionalities, features and analyse steps of user interaction though user flows\n   \n\n  \n\n Leads the prototyping of product, always ensuring the usability of the products and their alignment with customers\u2019 needs\n   \n\n  \n\n Host usability testing sessions with end users to identify and improve the gaps in final designs before shipping them for development\n   \n\n  \n\n Enable development team and stakeholders to create user centred solution in less time, effort and iteration\n   \n\n  \n\n Leverage AI to augment every phase of the design process and design deliverables.\n   \n\n  \n\n**Qualifications:**\n Bachelors or Masters of Design (B. Des. Or M. Des.) in Digital Design, User Experience Design or User Interaction Design\n   \n\n  \n\n**Essential requirements:**\n Online portfolio to demonstrate design projects, process, and knowledge\n   \n\n  \n\n Job responsibilities\n   \n\n  \n\n**Competencies** \n :\n   \n\n  \n\n  \n\n* Design thinking\n* User centred design process\n* Lean UX\n* User research\n* Design discovery workshops\n* Design artefacts (Persona, Journey maps, Storyboards)\n* Information architecture\n* Accessibility\n* Usability\n* Heuristics\n* Prototyping (low and high fidelity)\n* Usability testing\n* Proficiency in Figma\n* Quantify UX with measurable outcomes\n* AI\\-assisted Design\n\n\n What we offer\n   \n\n  \n\n**Exciting Projects:** \n We focus on industries like High\\-Tech, communication, media, healthcare, retail and telecom. Our customer list is full of fantastic global brands and leaders who love what we build for them.\n   \n\n  \n\n**Collaborative Environment:** \n You Can expand your skills by collaborating with a diverse team of highly talented people in an open, laidback environment \u2014 or even abroad in one of our global centers or client facilities!\n   \n\n  \n\n**Work\\-Life Balance:** \n GlobalLogic prioritizes work\\-life balance, which is why we offer flexible work schedules, opportunities to work from home, and paid time off and holidays.\n   \n\n  \n\n**Professional Development:** \n Our dedicated Learning \\& Development team regularly organizes Communication skills training(GL Vantage, Toast Master),Stress Management program, professional certifications, and technical and soft skill trainings.\n   \n\n  \n\n**Excellent Benefits:** \n We provide our employees with competitive salaries, family medical insurance, Group Term Life Insurance, Group Personal Accident Insurance , NPS(National Pension Scheme ), Periodic health awareness program, extended maternity leave, annual performance bonuses, and referral bonuses.\n   \n\n  \n\n**Fun Perks:** \n We want you to love where you work, which is why we host sports events, cultural activities, offer food on subsidies rates, Corporate parties. Our vibrant offices also include dedicated GL Zones, rooftop decks and GL Club where you can drink coffee or tea with your colleagues over a game of table and offer discounts for popular stores and restaurants!\n   \n\n  \n\n**About GlobalLogic**\n GlobalLogic, a Hitachi Group Company, is a trusted digital engineering partner to the world\u2019s largest and most forward\\-thinking companies. Since 2000, we\u2019ve been at the forefront of the digital revolution \u2013 helping create some of the most innovative and widely used digital products and experiences. Today we continue to collaborate with clients in transforming businesses and redefining industries through intelligent products, platforms, and services."},{"title":"Graphic Designer - Fresher","company":"Blostem","location":"Noida","date_posted":"2026-09-05","url":"https://www.shine.com/jobs/graphic-designer-fresher/blostem/19536566","experience":"1 to 5 Yrs","skills":[7,103,107,115,116,117],"is_walkin":false},{"title":"Graphic Designer (Packaging & Print)","company":"The New Ways B.V.","location":"Noida","date_posted":"2026-09-05","url":"https://www.shine.com/jobs/graphic-designer-packaging-print/the-new-ways-bv/19536582","experience":"3 to 7 Yrs","skills":[107,115],"is_walkin":false},{"title":"Motion Graphics Designer","company":"TraviYo","location":"Noida","date_posted":"2026-09-05","url":"https://www.shine.com/jobs/motion-graphics-designer/traviyo/19534002","experience":"1 to 5 Yrs","s